@title Cabinet plate (1920x1080): EMC findings the engine gives no place (motor cable shield, pigtail) are marked at their drive and pigtail end
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# Ctrl+K "EMC view on the plate": the shielded-cable fixture has an EMC-04 and an EMC-05 finding. They are numbered hot spots in the panel and marked on the plate, at the drive and at the pigtail end.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-shields.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
expect "Motor cable shield"
expect "Shield pigtail"
shot plate-unplaced-markers
check_layout
click_text "Shields" #1
wait 15
shot plate-unplaced-markers-with-shields
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 10
expect "Indicative model"
shot plate-unplaced-markers-light
check_layout
